<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates in 9.50-9.75 pct range.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates in 9.50-9.75 pct range.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar were steady in a high 9.50-9.75 pct range on Monday in a persistently tight market cushioned by strong dinar demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>Bankers and dealers attribute the tight market to continued substantial fund transfers by state ministries to the Central Bank that have kept the market short with no weakening in strong borrowing demand.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
